; The Data Center's own weight for an enemy three floors share. A shared `EnemySpawn` is one number
; that has to be right for every floor listing it, and the Help Desk's filler cannot also be the
; third floor's staple: at 2.0 the Ticket Bot was 7.6 of this floor's 17 enemies, more than the two
; enemies the floor was built around put together. It is kept rather than dropped because the roster
; still needs something mild to open with, and the teaching room forces two of them.
weight = 0.7
min_difficulty = 1
